<view class="customer-service-container">
  <!-- 主要客服入口 -->
  <view class="main-contact-section">
    <button class="main-contact-button" openType="contact">
      <view class="contact-card">
        <view class="contact-main">
          <t-icon name="chat" size="40rpx" color="#1890ff" />
          <view class="contact-text">
            <text class="contact-title">在线客服</text>
            <text class="contact-desc">工作日 9:00-18:00</text>
          </view>
        </view>
        <text class="contact-arrow">›</text>
      </view>
    </button>
  </view>

  <!-- App 更新说明 -->
  <view class="info-section">
    <view class="info-card">
      <view class="info-header">
        <view class="info-icon-wrapper info-icon-wrapper--app">
          <text class="info-icon">📱</text>
        </view>
        <text class="info-title">App 无法正常使用？</text>
      </view>
      <view class="info-content">
        <view class="info-item">
          <view class="info-dot"></view>
          <text class="info-text">若您使用的是小区楼号 App，出现闪退、无法登录、地图空白、功能异常等情况，请先前往应用商店将 App 更新到最新版本。</text>
        </view>
        <view class="info-item">
          <view class="info-dot"></view>
          <text class="info-text">更新后仍无法使用，可尝试卸载后重新安装；安装时建议使用微信登录。</text>
        </view>
        <view class="info-item">
          <view class="info-dot"></view>
          <text class="info-text">完成上述操作后问题依旧存在，再通过上方「在线客服」联系我们，并说明手机型号、系统版本与 App 版本。</text>
        </view>
        <view class="alert-tip">
          <text class="alert-tip-text">若重新登录后发现会员权益不见了，可以换其他微信账号登录试试。</text>
        </view>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <!-- App 下载 -->
  <view class="download-section">
    <view class="section-title">App 下载</view>
    <view class="download-list">
      <view class="download-item download-item-ios" bindtap="handleDownloadClick" data-platform="ios">
        <view class="download-item-main">
          <t-icon name="logo-apple" size="40rpx" color="#007AFF" />
          <view class="download-item-text">
            <text class="download-item-title">苹果 App 下载</text>
            <text class="download-item-desc">App Store 搜索「小区楼号地图-快递外卖极速导航」</text>
          </view>
        </view>
        <text class="download-item-arrow">›</text>
      </view>
      <view class="download-item download-item-android" bindtap="handleDownloadClick" data-platform="android">
        <view class="download-item-main">
          <t-icon name="download" size="40rpx" color="#E85827" />
          <view class="download-item-text">
            <text class="download-item-title">安卓 App 下载</text>
            <text class="download-item-desc">应用宝 / 小米 / OPPO 等应用商店</text>
          </view>
        </view>
        <text class="download-item-arrow">›</text>
      </view>
      <view class="download-item download-item-harmony" bindtap="handleDownloadClick" data-platform="harmony">
        <view class="download-item-main">
          <t-icon name="download" size="40rpx" color="#CF0A2C" />
          <view class="download-item-text">
            <text class="download-item-title">鸿蒙 App 下载</text>
            <text class="download-item-desc">华为应用市场搜索「小区楼号」</text>
          </view>
        </view>
        <text class="download-item-arrow">›</text>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="link-card">
      <view class="link-card-title">备用下载链接（可复制）</view>
      <view class="link-row" wx:for="{{downloadLinks}}" wx:key="key">
        <view class="link-row-main">
          <text class="link-row-label">{{item.label}}</text>
          <text class="link-row-url">{{item.url}}</text>
          <text class="link-row-tip" wx:if="{{item.tip}}">{{item.tip}}</text>
        </view>
        <view class="link-copy-btn" bindtap="onCopyLink" data-url="{{item.url}}" data-toast="{{item.copyToast}}">复制</view>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>
</view>